{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":488056,\"title\":\"The Adventures of Pericles\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A storm at sea brings love into the life of Pericles, Prince of Tyre – and another snatches it away. Filled with music and brilliant spectacle, this magical production of Shakespeare’s epic adventure is a delight for the eye and ear as it follows a fairy-tale hero on his miraculous journey to one of drama’s most poignant reunions. A story rarely told – and one you won’t soon forget.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6PmDAF6I5aQX0TKxI96drZIowXe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2016,\"runtime\":141,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Barry Avrich\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":666935,\"name\":\"Barry Avrich\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lmTmLUr0yqTzcaxVvxuxPNWOEwu.jpg\"},{\"id\":81099,\"name\":\"Scott Wentworth\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/doMJiwnxFI0xdLDU72jcjJkm8Jc.jpg\"},{\"id\":1926521,\"name\":\"Evan Buliung\",\"character\":\"Pericles\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5gVj24IP8gB0rYsRa4HQcE59KCH.jpg\"},{\"id\":1432978,\"name\":\"Deborah Hay\",\"character\":\"Thaisa / Marina\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2703594,\"name\":\"Marion Adler\",\"character\":\"Diana / Lychorida\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kP9X8uNmlWsguOCb8XPneDVm6XX.jpg\"},{\"id\":44164,\"name\":\"Wayne Best\",\"character\":\"Antiochus / Simonides / Mytilene Gentleman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mjfKSDqJxhOXfWG9SkFleisbPGO.jpg\"},{\"id\":2636583,\"name\":\"E.B. Smith\",\"character\":\"Thaliard / Leonine / Mytilene Gentleman\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1366358,\"name\":\"David Collins\",\"character\":\"Cerimon / Messenger\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tjALB3pTOZpq28Q3VoznWGK8yIU.jpg\"},{\"id\":1652716,\"name\":\"Stephen Russell\",\"character\":\"Helicanus\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":166476,\"name\":\"Victor Ertmanis\",\"character\":\"Escanes / Ship Master / Antioch Attendant / First Fisherman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wFG0XcpKtizOaVdBqg2VnRHvqoT.jpg\"},{\"id\":1545270,\"name\":\"Sean Arbuckle\",\"character\":\"Cleon / Pentapolis Gentleman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4ZDQ82SYVGfp7qTaaYtQ0yay1Ga.jpg\"},{\"id\":77096,\"name\":\"Claire Lautier\",\"character\":\"Dionyza\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eFhXJhon5Q9VEAvLJwrcIWFCW8j.jpg\"},{\"id\":2703597,\"name\":\"Jacqueline Burtney\",\"character\":\"Philoten / Maiden Priest / Prostitute\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":944584,\"name\":\"Jane Spidell\",\"character\":\"Philemon / Maiden Priest\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lcQR17SGD6qPc9tyJQrHWFN3qcZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":2109774,\"name\":\"Antoine Yared\",\"character\":\"Lysimachus / Tyre Lord / Pentapolis Footman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i43V0dqRGksuMpQC5hIN0r4mrBM.jpg\"},{\"id\":1652709,\"name\":\"Keith Dinicol\",\"character\":\"Pander / Pentapolis Gentleman\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2703602,\"name\":\"Brigit Wilson\",\"character\":\"Bawd\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":791523,\"title\":\"Wildwood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/snFM00mpNAfUzUtkdEW0uDEvXA0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sl5NJ1vtyhP9Vr88bB4blULsJYp.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Prue and her classmate Curtis are drawn into a magical forest filled with enchanted creatures, loyal allies, and formidable adversaries as they embark on a desperate quest to rescue Prue's abducted baby brother from a murder of crows led by a mysterious woman named Alexandra.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":157336,\"title\":\"Interstellar\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yQvGrMoipbRoddT0ZR8tPoR7NfX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8sNiAPPYU14PUepFNeSNGUTiHW.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The adventures of a group of explorers who make use of a newly discovered wormhole to surpass the limitations on human space travel and conquer the vast distances involved in an interstellar voyage.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1560520,\"title\":\"Batman: Knightfall Part 1: Knightfall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/360qdtu2hLnqMu8SVHMywn420w1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/caBIySpwuFi2i7ynvHIlnxJLOdN.jpg\",\"rating\":9.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Arkham Asylum has been destroyed, and all its inmates have been unleashed upon Gotham City. As Batman races to round up some of his greatest enemies, he is pushed to his physical and mental limits and into a final confrontation with a new threat: the man called Bane!\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":98,\"title\":\"Gladiator\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aDb548BOkFfI4nFm0kx8A3Ezh7H.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Ar7QuJ7sJEiC0oP3I8fKBKIQD9u.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the death of Emperor Marcus Aurelius, his devious son takes power and demotes Maximus, one of Rome's most capable generals who Marcus preferred. Eventually, Maximus is forced to become a gladiator and battle to the death against other men for the amusement of paying audiences.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1284465,\"title\":\"The Death of Robin Hood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/13MmRwmG5NmaMfU8qNrtgGXisiD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lh3BDkmWJh998n4fQcHYcVi7dpm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Grappling with his past after a life of crime and murder, Robin Hood finds himself gravely injured after a battle he thought would be his last. In the hands of a mysterious woman, he is offered a chance at salvation.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":150540,\"title\":\"Inside Out\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2H1TmgdfNtsKlU9jKdeNyYL5y8T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jJKZaTBNenlFclQyjrnvzkRmvWE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When 11-year-old Riley moves to a new city, her Emotions team up to help her through the transition. Joy, Fear, Anger, Disgust and Sadness work together, but when Joy and Sadness get lost, they must journey through unfamiliar places to get back home.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":286217,\"title\":\"The Martian\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5BHuvQ6p9kfc091Z8RiFNhCwL4b.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lzMS0CI3FLQYC5EgJoWeIaEt0lm.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a manned mission to Mars, Astronaut Mark Watney is presumed dead after a fierce storm and left behind by his crew. But Watney has survived and finds himself stranded and alone on the hostile planet. With only meager supplies, he must draw upon his ingenuity, wit and spirit to subsist and find a way to signal to Earth that he is alive.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1288069,\"title\":\"Tenzing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eI0QW02PYqhnmIvLRdn9vrfVVP7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tKvVgMfM6GS4AGZn2KhP8bX1mJm.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A determined man embarks on a high-stakes quest—and defies seemingly impossible odds—to fulfill his dream of being the first to reach the summit of Mount Everest.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1495,\"title\":\"Kingdom of Heaven\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2NaFdWy9hkM35vZB1hkqsnTcms8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kP8rK9dGS1pr0HrnmXfIi2heWjo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After his wife dies, a blacksmith named Balian is thrust into royalty, political intrigue and bloody holy wars during the Crusades.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":558449,\"title\":\"Gladiator II\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2cxhvwyEwRlysAmRH4iodkvo0z5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tOqIwliWMovSIZ9DyvHcHI7p2im.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Years after witnessing the death of the revered hero Maximus at the hands of his uncle, Lucius is forced to enter the Colosseum after his home is conquered by the tyrannical Emperors who now lead Rome with an iron fist. With rage in his heart and the future of the Empire at stake, Lucius must look to his past to find strength and honor to return the glory of Rome to its people.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":18239,\"title\":\"The Twilight Saga: New Moon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k2qTooPlHffgNABNWxeJdGMglPK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dF2c20sRDgySZLaLS2OUerL07sz.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Forks, Washington resident Bella Swan is reeling from the departure of her vampire love, Edward Cullen, and finds comfort in her friendship with Jacob Black, a werewolf. But before she knows it, she's thrust into a centuries-old conflict, and her desire to be with Edward at any cost leads her to take greater and greater risks.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":420818,\"title\":\"The Lion King\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dzBtMocZuJbjLOXvrl4zGYigDzh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1TUg5pO1VZ4B0Q1amk3OlXvlpXV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Simba idolizes his father, King Mufasa, and takes to heart his own royal destiny. But not everyone in the kingdom celebrates the new cub's arrival. Scar, Mufasa's brother—and former heir to the throne—has plans of his own. The battle for Pride Rock is ravaged with betrayal, tragedy and drama, ultimately resulting in Simba's exile. With help from a curious pair of newfound friends, Simba will have to figure out how to grow up and take back what is rightfully his.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"z9E7jv01-XU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"idN6gU0TXM0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"urm-sOufIco\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}